23	UPDATE "evidence_sources" SET "notes" = 'MIRROR OF REF-01031: a legal-wiki (NEPLA) reproduction of Annex 1 under the stamp <개정 2023. 12. 11.>. The official text (law.go.kr flDownload PDF) was retrieved after the adversarial pass and is admitted as REF-01031; item 12 and the 비고 read identically, and this row''s extractions are re-rooted to REF-01031. Kept as the record of what was first retrieved. Issuing ministry not stated in the retrieved text. || SUPERSEDED 2026-10-02 by session_2026-10-01-research-batch-23: by REF-01031: REF-01019 is the NEPLA wiki''s transcription of the Enforcement Rule''s Annex 1 (title, year and author identical to REF-01031, the official law.go.kr file read afterwards). Its extractions 82 and 83 carry the same text and figures as 107 and 108 on REF-01031; the independence count already follows root_ref_id to REF-01031. Superseded so the mirror is not counted as a second source (assess_cell.gather_sources) and test_db_integrity D04 reads one live source.', "updated_at" = '2026-10-02 02:29', "superseded_by_ref_id" = 'REF-01031' WHERE "ref_id" = 'REF-01019';
